<doc id="93798" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=93798" title="Draco Malfoy">
Draco Malfoy

Draco Malfoy ya iku karakter &lt;a href="fiksi"&gt;fiksi&lt;/a&gt; sajeroning seri &lt;a href="Harry%20Potter"&gt;Harry Potter&lt;/a&gt; karangan &lt;a href="J.K%20Rowling"&gt;J.K Rowling&lt;/a&gt;. Ing filme tokoh Draco Malfoy diperanake déning &lt;a href="Tom%20Felton"&gt;Tom Felton&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
Draco Malfoy laing tanggal &lt;a href="05%20Juni"&gt;05 Juni&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt; ya iku penyihir keturunan penyihir murni,putra saka &lt;a href="Lucius%20Malfoy"&gt;Lucius Malfoy&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Narcissa%20Malfoy"&gt;Narcissa Malfoy&lt;/a&gt;. Draco lumebu ing &lt;a href="sekolah"&gt;sekolah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sikir"&gt;sikir&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Hogwarts"&gt;Hogwarts&lt;/a&gt; ing taun &lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt; nganti &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt; lan kalebu ing asrama &lt;a href="Slytherin"&gt;Slytherin&lt;/a&gt;, kaya kulawargané liyané. Samangsa ing Hogwarts, Draco kekancan karo &lt;a href="Vincent%20Crabbe"&gt;Vincent Crabbe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gregory%20Goyle"&gt;Gregory Goyle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pansy%20Parkinson"&gt;Pansy Parkinson&lt;/a&gt; lan murid-murid Slytherin liyané kang ora seneng lan musuhi Harry Potter.
Draco dadi &lt;a href="prefek%20asrama"&gt;prefek asrama&lt;/a&gt; slytherin lan dadi anggota Regu Penyelidik ing taun kelima, kang akhire bapakne dikunjara ing &lt;a href="Azkaban"&gt;Azkaban&lt;/a&gt; sawisé Pertempuran karo &lt;a href="Laskar%20Dumbledore"&gt;Laskar Dumbledore&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Departemen%20Misteri"&gt;Departemen Misteri&lt;/a&gt;. 
&lt;a href="Lord%20Voldemort"&gt;Lord Voldemort&lt;/a&gt; nugasi Draco kanggo nggenteni gagale Lucius, kang ndadeake Draco dadi pelahap maut ing umur nembelas taun. Nanging Draco nglakoni tugase kanthi keweden lan ora bisa ngrampungke tugase, matèni &lt;a href="Albus%20Dumbledore"&gt;Albus Dumbledore&lt;/a&gt;, kang banjur dirampungake déning &lt;a href="Severus%20Snape"&gt;Severus Snape&lt;/a&gt;. Draco lan kulawargané akhire mbelot saka Voldemort sadurungé perang ing taun kapitu nalika Voldemort pungkasane kalah déning Harry Potter. Akhire Draco malfoy krama karo &lt;a href="Astoria%20Greengrass"&gt;Astoria Greengrass&lt;/a&gt; lan duwé Putra siji ya iku &lt;a href="Scorpius%20Malfoy"&gt;Scorpius Malfoy&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Ciri-ciri Fsik</h2>
Ciri-ciri Fsik.
