Carlos Alberto Tévez (terlahir Carlos Alberto Martínez, #ALIH) ya iku juru main &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; sing asalé saka &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt; sing main minangka &lt;a href="striker"&gt;striker&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="Manchester%20City%20F.C."&gt;Manchester City&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Liga%20Primer%20Inggris"&gt;Liga Primer Inggris&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt;.
Tévez miwiti karir minangka juru main yunior ing &lt;a href="All%20Boys"&gt;All Boys&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Boca%20Juniors"&gt;Boca Juniors&lt;/a&gt;. Panjenengané uga naté main kanggo &lt;a href="Boca%20Juniors"&gt;Boca Juniors&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sport%20Club%20Corinthians%20Paulista"&gt;Corinthians&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="West%20Ham%20United%20F.C."&gt;West Ham United&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Manchester%20United%20F.C."&gt;Manchester United F.C.&lt;/a&gt; sadurungé gabung karo &lt;a href="Manchester%20City%20F.C."&gt;Manchester City F.C.&lt;/a&gt;. Tévez wes kaping telu kapilih minangka Pemain Paling Apik &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Kidul"&gt;Amérika Kidul&lt;/a&gt; (2003, 2004, 2005). Panjenengané lan &lt;a href="Dimitar%20Berbatov"&gt;Dimitar Berbatov&lt;/a&gt; dadi topskor &lt;a href="Liga%20Utama%20Inggris%202010%E2%80%9311"&gt;Liga Utama Inggris mangsa 2010-11&lt;/a&gt; kanthi nggawe 20 gol. Tévez éntuk medhali &lt;a href="emas"&gt;emas&lt;/a&gt; nalika main ing timnas &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt; U23 ing &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Athena%202004"&gt;Olimpiade Athena 2004&lt;/a&gt;. Panjenengané wes main kanggo timnas senior &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt; wiwit &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; 2004.
