Sergio Leonel "Kun" Agüero del Castillo (#ALIH) ya iku juru main &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; sing nduwé kebangsaan &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt; sing main minangka &lt;a href="penyerang"&gt;penyerang&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="Manchester%20City%20F.C."&gt;Manchester City&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Liga%20Primer%20Inggris"&gt;Liga Primer Inggris&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt;.
Agüero main kanggo &lt;a href="Independiente"&gt;Independiente&lt;/a&gt; wiwit &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt; tekan &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;. Panjenengané banjur gabung karo &lt;a href="Atletico%20Madrid"&gt;Atletico Madrid&lt;/a&gt; tekan &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; 2011. Ing wulan &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; 2011, Agüero gabung ing &lt;a href="Manchester%20City%20F.C."&gt;Manchester City&lt;/a&gt; kanthi nandatangani kontrak sing durasiné limang &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt;.
Agüero sing duwé jelukan akrab Kun iki, bareng &lt;a href="Lionel%20Messi"&gt;Lionel Messi&lt;/a&gt; dianggep publik donya minangka titisan saka &lt;a href="Diego%20Maradona"&gt;Diego Maradona&lt;/a&gt;. Jenengé sangsaya kethok nalika nggawa timnas &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt; U-20 minangka juara &lt;a href="Piala%20Donya%20FIFA"&gt;Piala Donya FIFA&lt;/a&gt; U-20 20075 lan &lt;a href="Piala%20Dunia%20FIFA"&gt;Piala Dunia FIFA&lt;/a&gt; U-20 2007. Prestasi mau nggawé jengengé lumebu ing njero skuat &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt;.
Agüero nyetak rekor minangka juru main &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; paling enom ing sajarah Primera División &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt; nalika main ing &lt;a href="Independiente"&gt;Independiente&lt;/a&gt; nglawan &lt;a href="San%20Lorenzo"&gt;San Lorenzo&lt;/a&gt; ing umur 15 &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; 35 dina tanggal 7 &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; 2003.
Agüero minangka "mantu" saka &lt;a href="Diego%20Maradona"&gt;Diego Maradona&lt;/a&gt;, sawisé panjenengané dadi pacare Giannina Maradona, putri paling enom Maradona wiwit pungkasan &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; 2007 lan duwé siji putra jenengé Benjamin, sing lair nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; 2009 saka pacaré mau.
