Kadhaton Balmoral punika griya ageng ingkang mapan wonten ing wewengkon &lt;a href="Aberdeenshire"&gt;Aberdeenshire&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sekotlan"&gt;Sekotlan&lt;/a&gt;. Griya punika dipunpundhut déning &lt;a href="Ratu%20Victoria"&gt;Ratu Victoria&lt;/a&gt;.
