Audrey Tautou

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Audrey Justine Tautou (lair &lt;a href="1976"&gt;1976&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku aktris filem &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt;, kondhang amarga karakter ing filem kang menangke pangaji Film 2001 &lt;a href="Le%20Fabuleux%20Destin%20d%27Am%C3%A9lie%20Poulain"&gt;Le Fabuleux Destin d'Amélie Poulain&lt;/a&gt;, Sophie Neveu ing filem thriller 2006 &lt;a href="Da%20Vinci%20Code"&gt;Da Vinci Code&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ir%C3%A8ne%20in%20Priceless"&gt;Irène in Priceless&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Coco%20Chanel"&gt;Coco Chanel&lt;/a&gt; ing Coco avant Chanel. Audrey menangke Panghargan &lt;a href="C%C3%A9sar%20Award"&gt;César Award&lt;/a&gt; kanggo Most Promising Actress Beauty ing &lt;a href="Venus%20Institute"&gt;Venus Institute&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;). Tautou lair ing &lt;a href="Beaumont"&gt;Beaumont&lt;/a&gt;, ing département Puy-de-Dôme of Auvergne, lan gedhé ing &lt;a href="Montlu%C3%A7on"&gt;Montluçon&lt;/a&gt; ing laladan &lt;a href="Allier"&gt;Allier&lt;/a&gt;. Bapak saka Tautou ya iku ahli bedhah mulut lan ibu Tautou ya iku dadi guru. Tautou sekolah akting ing &lt;a href="Florent%20Cours"&gt;Florent Cours&lt;/a&gt;
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Ing taun &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;, Tautou mèlu ing kompetisi kang disponsori Canal kang mau &lt;a href="Jeunes%20Premiers"&gt;Jeunes Premiers&lt;/a&gt; (The Young Debut) lan menangke kategori Aktris Muda Terbaik ing 9th Béziers Festival of Young Actors. &lt;a href="Tonie%20Marshall"&gt;Tonie Marshall&lt;/a&gt; mènèhi Tautou ing filem &lt;a href="Beauty%20C%C3%A9sar"&gt;Beauty César&lt;/a&gt; lan menang Venus Institute (1999, alias Venus beauté (institut)). Ing taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;, Tautou menagake &lt;a href="%27%27Prix%20Suzanne%20Bianchetti%27%27"&gt;Prix Suzanne Bianchetti&lt;/a&gt; dadi aktris enom filem kang paling mumpuni ing nagarané.
Taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;, Tautou miwiti kondhang ing Internasional amarga duwé peran dadi pemimpin èksèntrik ing filem komedi romantis &lt;a href="Le%20Fabuleux%20Destin%20d%27Am%C3%A9lie%20Poulain%20%28Am%C3%A9lie%29"&gt;Le Fabuleux Destin d'Amélie Poulain (Amélie)&lt;/a&gt;. Ing sasi &lt;a href="Juni"&gt;Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, Tautou diundang kanggo lumebu gabung ing &lt;a href="Akademi%20Seni%20Gerak%20Picture%20dan%20Ilmu%20Pengetahuan%20%28AMPAS%29"&gt;Akademi Seni Gerak Picture dan Ilmu Pengetahuan (AMPAS)&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, Tautou miwiti mudhun ing &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt;, main bareng &lt;a href="Tom%20Hanks"&gt;Tom Hanks&lt;/a&gt;, ing versi filem saka novèl &lt;a href="Dan%20Brown"&gt;Dan Brown&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Da%20Vinci%20Code"&gt;The Da Vinci Code&lt;/a&gt;, kang disutradarai &lt;a href="Ron%20Howard"&gt;Ron Howard&lt;/a&gt; lan dirilis ing &lt;a href="M%C3%A8i"&gt;Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;. Tautou uga main karo &lt;a href="Gad%20Elmaleh"&gt;Gad Elmaleh&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Pierre%20Salvadori%27s%20Hors%20de%20prix%20%28Priceless%29"&gt;Pierre Salvadori's Hors de prix (Priceless)&lt;/a&gt;, dirilis ing &lt;a href="13"&gt;13&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;. Film- filem iku disetarake karo filem &lt;a href="Breakfast%20at%20Tiffany"&gt;Breakfast at Tiffany&lt;/a&gt;.
Tautou main bareng &lt;a href="Guillaume%20Canet"&gt;Guillaume Canet&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Claude%20Berri%27s%20Ensemble"&gt;Claude Berri's Ensemble&lt;/a&gt;, c'est tout ing taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, adhaptasi saka novèl &lt;a href="eponymous"&gt;eponymous&lt;/a&gt; déning &lt;a href="Anna%20Gavalda"&gt;Anna Gavalda&lt;/a&gt;.
Audrey Tautou dadi modhèl ing video "I Love Your Smile", tembang déning penyanyi-panulis tembang &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Charlie%20Winston"&gt;Charlie Winston&lt;/a&gt;.
