<doc id="94092" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=94092" title="Abu Thalib">
Abu Thalib

Abū Thālib bin ‘Abdul-Muththalib (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Basa Arab&lt;/a&gt;: أبو طالب بن عبد المطلب‎) (&lt;a href="539"&gt;539&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="540"&gt;540&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="619"&gt;619&lt;/a&gt;) inggih punika ramanipun &lt;a href="Ali%20bin%20Abi%20Thalib"&gt;Ali bin Abi Thalib&lt;/a&gt; sarta paman saking &lt;a href="Muhammad"&gt;Muhammad&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng aslinipun Imran (&lt;a href="Bahasa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: عمران), nanging ingkang misuwur dipunnamani Abu Thalib, ingkang tegesipun ramanipun &lt;a href="Thalib%20bin%20Abu%20Thalib"&gt;Thalib&lt;/a&gt;.
Minangka pamarsa &lt;a href="Bani%20Hasyim"&gt;Bani Hasyim&lt;/a&gt; sasampunipun ramanipun pejah &lt;a href="Abdul%20Muththalib"&gt;Abdul Muththalib&lt;/a&gt;, piyambakipun dados pengasuh &lt;a href="Muhammad"&gt;Muhammad&lt;/a&gt; saha pandukung utami nabi kanggé dakwah, Abū Thālib nggarwa &lt;a href="Fatimah%20binti%20Asad"&gt;Fatimah binti Asad&lt;/a&gt; saha gadhah nem putra.
